// OathRechargeMechanic - generated task stub (no implementation here)
// Responsibilities:
// - Detect ring contact/interaction with battery socket (portable or central).
// - Prompt player to speak the Oath; record mic audio (bounded duration).
// - POST audio to configured HTTPS STT endpoint with timeout (e.g., 2000 ms).
// - On response, fuzzy-match recognized text against canonical Oath with threshold.
// - Success: play recharge_vfx_aura centered on player, refill ring_energy to max, short haptic pulse, update HUD.
// - Failure: show retry/failure prompt, start cooldown timer; do not modify energy.
// - Offline/dev override: designer can force success for testing.
// - Persist ring_energy and last outcome across scene loads as needed.
//
// Expected Config (via scene JSON or inspector):
//   battery_socket_tag: string  // trigger or interact tag required to start
//   stt_url: string             // HTTPS endpoint
//   stt_api_key_secret: string  // engine-managed secret id or header key
//   stt_timeout_ms: int         // e.g., 2000
//   oath_text: string           // canonical Oath
//   match_threshold: float      // 0..1, e.g., 0.82
//   mic_max_record_sec: float   // e.g., 6.0
//   cooldown_sec: float         // e.g., 5.0
//   refill_to_percent: int      // e.g., 100
//   vfx_asset_id: string        // 'recharge_vfx_aura'
//   ui_prompt_ids: { start, listening, validating, success, fail }
//   allow_offline_override: bool
//   resource_id: string         // 'ring_energy'
//
// Integration Points:
// - Uses builtin.use_interact or a trigger volume on the battery socket to begin capture.
// - Modifies builtin.inventory resource 'ring_energy'.
// - Displays prompts on ui_ring_hud.
// - Plays haptics on success/failure via right hand.
// - Emits events: OnOathAttempt, OnOathSuccess, OnOathFail (optional for scripting).
//
// Notes:
// - Ensure non-blocking HTTP; handle timeout and error codes gracefully.
// - Debounce input so repeated presses during cooldown are ignored.
// - Support both 'central_battery_chamber' and 'oa_plaza' scenes.
//
// Acceptance Criteria Mapping:
// - oath_recharge_success_cloud: success path plays VFX and sets energy to 100%.
// - oath_recharge_failure_path: failure shows prompt and applies cooldown; no energy gain.
// - portable_battery_recharge_in_plaza: same flow works on portable battery in plaza.
